    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 99,
        "text": "Hi, Ben. Are you free on Saturday? We are organising a lantern festival in the community hall.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "112e63dc33cf2af1c8ed95d6ea42b3873b2e90b85ae2f1c5de1ae00c905a43e5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 105,
        "sourceEnd": 169,
        "text": "A lantern festival? That sounds fun. What do you need help with?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "dbe5521ac21db56527b75843350c898832c3e1cc085da02168992f3a46a2ed3c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 175,
        "sourceEnd": 322,
        "text": "Well, I was making lanterns yesterday when my sister called. She said she could help too. While I was cutting paper, she was painting the lanterns.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "e0c3599c7b75a7f3348a2257827d8667ec95a9893f98d0ee44ca6762411f3fad",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 328,
        "sourceEnd": 375,
        "text": "Great. Who is the person in charge of the food?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "080f57fd18026fb6aad1b8520a96ad5308c14aa314ee2a26a2af30a989e1f2d4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 381,
        "sourceEnd": 491,
        "text": "That's Mr. Chen. He is the man who owns the noodle shop on Green Street. He was cooking soup when I asked him.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "a3574c563d7568d040fc085efa1dd76bf4764a41ef8d88933ec0a959d9d6d9c5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 497,
        "sourceEnd": 531,
        "text": "Nice. And which room are we using?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "716f2a7d95a8d428aa9e926348c7faca543e4c7e26fdf30b4aed69e7eda206a6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 537,
        "sourceEnd": 640,
        "text": "Room 2, the big room which has a stage. We were moving tables there when the caretaker told us to stop.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "5f34320184553fefb15b90ce8ec37d81cf6eb4cc63bd13a853e286a75b49bfa3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 646,
        "sourceEnd": 666,
        "text": "Why did he stop you?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "6b4b74c1ff843216a12fbc42736ffb62ffcb3a0a3ea10ad93f06e5a9f648168c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 672,
        "sourceEnd": 766,
        "text": "He said the floor was wet. So we waited. While we were waiting, we talked about the programme.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "fcfa976ca0c67b84f358914c3c5848a11d8b3cd745587c07c2e9be5178164f94",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 772,
        "sourceEnd": 787,
        "text": "What programme?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "b5e8614187903192add3328748a6b9720a71d9185b089699486ad5ae6da5a49d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 793,
        "sourceEnd": 939,
        "text": "There is a story-telling corner for children, and a dance show that starts at seven. The dance group which practises here every week will perform.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "40b452b798561dfd171de1971f97ac05ee10b29471ab0e5d1d251717f548d228",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 945,
        "sourceEnd": 987,
        "text": "I see. Was anyone taking photos last year?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "659cfcd6f375028f2643e59be945d75c944e87877e9dd3af3c38cc5295124cca",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 993,
        "sourceEnd": 1101,
        "text": "Yes, a student who studies photography took them. This year, we want someone who can make a short video too.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "4372fbb096672acfa6b43cf64f1e759d10747b3e86b6b7b1fbb8087a5a020421",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1107,
        "sourceEnd": 1162,
        "text": "I can do that. I was learning video editing last month.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "eefb6fdb6bbb798fab4b4f16dc61103441664bc5cb0a16e8f76ee761bb781367",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1168,
        "sourceEnd": 1253,
        "text": "Perfect! While you were learning, we were planning the posters. Can you come at five?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "26444d9ce102a0cd431d4fa925747a1fd8dbf5e0d19294e0f66bcf954649daa6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1259,
        "sourceEnd": 1314,
        "text": "Sure. I'll bring my camera which has a good microphone.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "ffc401ed2b457b4649a9419fed1b75ac7a66ed7406435f74fe79e0c41b5b10e5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1320,
        "sourceEnd": 1353,
        "text": "Thanks, Ben. See you on Saturday!",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "246b0f975d7a06a5d94ed9a0f889a258c827b9c860eb5bc694750c91ee3e3bd3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
